      "details": "<p>The name\u00a0means \"bridge of the daughter\" and is likely\u00a0named after a daughter of the builder of the <span>Pol-e Dokhtar</span>\u00a0bridge, the Sasanian ruler\u00a0Shapur I (241-272 A.D.).</p>",
